00:19:30.941 --> 00:19:33.152
It really...

00:19:33.861 --> 00:19:35.069
It makes me so happy.

00:19:38.449 --> 00:19:39.825
I'm happy too.

00:19:40.826 --> 00:19:42.410
Really happy.

00:19:42.411 --> 00:19:43.412
Yeah.

00:19:44.246 --> 00:19:45.331
Thank you.

00:19:46.832 --> 00:19:49.460
I look forward to
spending more time with you.

00:20:02.306 --> 00:20:05.392
Are you alright?

00:20:06.143 --> 00:20:08.312
You can't look!

00:20:08.854 --> 00:20:09.855
Kasuga?

00:20:10.356 --> 00:20:11.815
No, I mean... Sorry!

00:20:11.816 --> 00:20:13.566
I remembered I had something to do!

00:20:13.567 --> 00:20:15.277
What? Kasuga!

00:20:20.032 --> 00:20:21.115
Did she see it?

00:20:21.116 --> 00:20:22.326
Did I get away with it?

00:20:22.827 --> 00:20:24.995
Damn it, Nakamura!

00:20:27.164 --> 00:20:28.499
Nakamura!

00:20:29.124 --> 00:20:30.750
That was so mean of you!

00:20:30.751 --> 00:20:32.961
Shut it, traitor.

00:20:32.962 --> 00:20:34.880
Told you to strip those layers!

00:20:38.801 --> 00:20:42.136
I told you to kiss her!

00:20:43.556 --> 00:20:48.518
You were turned on by wearing this!
:cue

00:20:48.519 --> 00:20:53.357
You're just a disgusting,
freaky little perverted piece of shit!

00:21:00.865 --> 00:21:02.324
I...

00:21:03.284 --> 00:21:04.368
I've had...

00:21:04.869 --> 00:21:06.579
a tingling feeling

00:21:07.162 --> 00:21:08.914
for so long now.

00:21:11.041 --> 00:21:12.376
It's in my body...

00:21:12.877 --> 00:21:14.503
down there...

00:21:15.004 --> 00:21:16.839
inside...

00:21:17.423 --> 00:21:19.091
It's like it's screaming.

00:21:21.051 --> 00:21:23.304
I want this whole world

00:21:25.180 --> 00:21:28.391
to turn into a shit bug,

00:21:28.392 --> 00:21:31.353
engulfed by my frustration.

00:21:32.730 --> 00:21:35.566
I suppose I'm a pervert...

00:21:36.609 --> 00:21:37.943
too.

00:21:39.320 --> 00:21:40.321
"Too"?

00:21:42.156 --> 00:21:44.616
Fine, then. Why don't you date her?

00:21:44.617 --> 00:21:47.327
I'll make an exception and support you.

00:21:47.328 --> 00:21:50.747
I won't expose you
as a perverted gym clothes thief, either.

00:21:50.748 --> 00:21:52.665
Wait... Really?

00:21:52.666 --> 00:21:53.750
Sure.

00:21:53.751 --> 00:21:57.630
That is, if Saeki doesn't know already.

00:22:03.552 --> 00:22:04.845
She... she doesn't.

00:22:05.429 --> 00:22:07.306
I'm sure she hasn't figured it out.

00:22:09.934 --> 00:22:11.559
Surely, she hasn't.

00:22:11.560 --> 00:22:14.812
She doesn't know. She doesn't know.

00:22:14.813 --> 00:22:15.981
I'm sure she doesn't!

00:22:24.990 --> 00:22:26.867
Kasuga, I'm sorry.

00:22:28.786 --> 00:22:29.787
I just...

00:22:31.538 --> 00:22:33.415
I can't stand things like this.

00:22:36.627 --> 00:22:39.213
Does she... know?

00:22:48.597 --> 00:22:51.015
TO BE CONTINUED

00:23:48.073 --> 00:23:49.240
ON THE NEXT EPISODE

00:23:49.241 --> 00:23:52.869
Kasuga is on cloud nine,
as Saeki has accepted his feelings.

00:23:52.870 --> 00:23:56.664
But as Kasuga continues to pile up lies,
he ultimately begins to seek punishment.

00:23:56.665 --> 00:23:58.666
Next, on episode three,

00:23:58.667 --> 00:24:02.003
another flower of sin blooms at night
under the full moon.

00:24:02.004 --> 00:24:03.005
Translated by Yuka Kristi